  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mala Yero Gueye Rice Production and Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to improve the level of productivity for GIE MalalYeroGueyethrough the rehabilitation of existing land and procurement of a tractor that will help expand the area under production. They will also establish a revolving fund to also purchase paddy directly from out-grower producers; thereby increasing the production levels of the existing rice processing center.</narrative>
  </description>
